cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use rusle-terrace in a paper, thesis or planning report, cite it as below."
title: "rusle-terrace: RUSLE soil-erosion screening for terraced hillslope vineyards"
abstract: >-
  A small command-line tool that computes planning-level RUSLE soil-erosion
  estimates (A = R*K*LS*C*P) from a metric DEM, with D8 slope length, slope-class
  statistics, severity classes, map, JSON summary and Chinese Markdown report.
  Cover and support-practice factors are literature values and require local
  plot calibration before operational use.
